"""
Portfolio Lab - Quant Terminal
==============================

Institutional portfolio construction, risk decomposition, optimisation,
rebalancing, attribution, stress testing and governance layer.

Design principles
-----------------
- Standalone Streamlit module: no import from app.py and no circular dependency.
- No user code execution. CSV inputs are parsed as data only.
- No simulated value is presented as live or realised data.
- Optional SciPy acceleration. The module remains importable without SciPy.
- Deterministic optimisation initialisation and explicit diagnostics.
- Long-only and constrained long/short workflows.
- Current and target portfolios are always shown separately.

Public entry point
------------------
        render_portfolio_lab_v1(ticker, price_data, analysis)

The ``ticker``, ``price_data`` and ``analysis`` arguments match the existing
Quant Terminal routing convention. Portfolio Lab downloads its own multi-asset
history because the parent app currently passes only one instrument history.
"""

