# =============================================================================
# PORTFOLIO LAB V2 - INSTITUTIONAL WORKBENCH EXTENSION
# =============================================================================
#
# This extension deliberately builds on the stable v1 analytics above instead
# of rewriting the original engine.    The public v1 entry point is rebound at
# the end of this file so existing app.py imports continue to work unchanged.
#
# Major additions:
# - multi-model optimizer comparison and target selection;
# - true efficient frontier and allocation transition map;
# - periodic-rebalancing performance simulation with transaction costs;
# - rolling analytics, drawdown episodes, annual/monthly return diagnostics;
# - benchmark-relative statistics and richer portfolio metrics;
# - interactive what-if portfolio editor;
# - proxy factor exposure model;
# - execution/liquidity/TCA workbench;
# - scenario mixer and reverse stress testing;
# - walk-forward optimizer validation;
# - a governed signal bus for Decision Engine, Momentum, ML, Macro,
#      Company Intelligence, Backtest Lab, Risk Monitor and Options/Futures;
# - cross-module payload publishing through Streamlit session state.
#
# The extension remains optional-dependency light: NumPy, pandas, Plotly,
# Streamlit, yfinance and SciPy (for constrained optimisation).
# =============================================================================

